            "text": "The reading announces **[X]**. In the audio the students clearly agree with this new policy and provide reasons for it.\n\nFirst, the text claims **[T1]**, and the speaker supports this by explaining **[D1]** with **[brief evidence]**. \n\nSecond, the reading suggests **[T2]**, and the speaker reinforces it by adding **[D2]**, which leads to **[positive outcome]**. \n\nOverall, the audio supports the reading and indicates that [X] is a practical and effective solution."
